stb provides CMake targets:

    find_package(stb CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE stb)

Individual convenience sub-targets are also available:

    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE stb_image)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE stb_image_write)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE stb_truetype)

Headers are included as <stb_image.h>, <stb_image_write.h>, <stb_truetype.h>, etc.